Third-party software fetched at deploy time (not part of this repository or its image)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A deployment of ucsc-link may download the UCSC Kent BLAT tools (gfServer, gfClient,
gfPcr) from https://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/ (see docs/deployment.md). They are NOT
distributed with ucsc-link and are NOT covered by its MIT licence. BLAT and its
components are free for academic, non-profit and personal use; commercial use
requires a licence from Kent Informatics (https://kentinformatics.com).

